This license, including the FreshPress additions below, is the whole agreement about your license to the Product.


FRESHPRESS ADDITIONS

These additions are part of this license and apply only to FreshPress.

A. Official place of distribution. The official place where the free edition of FreshPress is distributed is https://github.com/indieops-co/freshpress.

B. Your team and your clients. FreshPress is a content-management system: you run it, and you give other people logins to it. People you give a login to your own FreshPress installation, such as your team members and your clients editing their own websites, may use it through that installation for work on the websites you manage. They do not need their own license, and giving them a login is not giving them a copy of the Product. Running one installation for other businesses that are not your clients (for example, selling FreshPress hosting as a service) needs written permission.

C. The WordPress plugin. The FreshPress Connector WordPress plugin in the wp-plugin/ folder is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or any later version (GPL-2.0-or-later), as stated in its files, and not under this license.

D. Third-party notices. The third-party material listed in NOTICE.md stays under its own licenses (section 8). Keep NOTICE.md with your copy.


